# Compiled Python bytecode must never be committed: a stale tracked .pyc
# can shadow an updated .py source on import (this caused a live ImportError
# on Streamlit Cloud after utils/recommendations.py was rewritten but its
# old __pycache__/recommendations.cpython-310.pyc stayed tracked).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
